 { Five months after the launch of this course, I asked for your feedback in a course announcement to collect all your burning questions. I truly appreciate your responses because they not only help me improve the content, but also show your diligence in studying my course. I took the cue from your questions and revised the entire course. However, as I am writing this, many of you have already completed the original version of the course. It would be rather difficult to sift through the whole course and scour for the changes. To make it convenient for you, I have compiled all the updates and answers to your questions in this Q&A chapter. For those who have already gone through the updated version of the course in full, please bear with the repetition. After all, there is no harm going through some material a second time. }  
