 { We have discussed that the best way to review your mistakes is by asking ‘What could I have done to avoid this mistake?’ and responding to the question concisely and promptly. Various techniques such as The Burger Technique and Reciprocal Thinking covered in this course enable you to do so efficiently. However, there are times where you struggle to answer this question. This is largely because you are unaware of the underlying pattern. In fact, some positions are only solvable with the knowledge of very specific patterns. Consider the following puzzle (on the next page) . }  
